          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "باعث شدن (bâ'es shodan) — \"to cause\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "باران باعث شد که دیر برسیم. bârân bâ'es shod ke dir berasim. The rain made us arrive late."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Bâ'es \"cause\" + shodan (stem shav-). With a noun: bâ'es-e chizi shodan; with a clause: bâ'es shod ke + subjunctive."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "باعث is usually traced to Arabic bā'ith \"that which sends or prompts\"; with the inherited Persian verb shodan \"to become\" it means to be the cause of something."
            }
          ]
        },
