              "text": "این خبر سبب شد که همه نگران شوند. in khabar sabab shod ke hame negarân shavand. This news made everyone worried."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Like bâ'es shodan, a little more formal; ke + subjunctive follows."
