              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "به علت (be 'ellat-e) — \"owing to, because of\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "مدرسه به علت برف تعطیل شد. madrese be 'ellat-e barf ta'til shod. School was closed because of the snow."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Takes a noun with ezafe; for a clause, be 'ellat-e inke …. Formal; in speech be khâter-e."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "به علت (be 'ellat-e) joins the Persian preposition be to 'ellat, from Arabic 'illa \"cause\" (EtymDB): by reason of."
            }
          ]
        },
